  "bio": "Mike Anthony is a supremely talented tattoo artist based in Hamilton, Ontario, specializing in illustrative and anime styles. You can admire his remarkable portfolio at Bond Tattoo Studio on Cannon Street, where his professionalism shines as much as his art. To book an appointment with this master of ink, drop him a direct message on Instagram and secure a spot on Sunday, Monday, Thursday, or Friday.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Hamilton, Ontario, Canada\n\nDM for bookings\nSun,Mon,Thurs,Fri\n@bondtattoostudio\n1209 Cannon st E, Hamilton",
